KeywordAbility(
    name: "ripple",
    params: [Amount],
    spelling: "ripple <Param(0)>",
    grammar: FixedKeyword(
        surface: "ripple",
    ),
    // STOP (waits on: `lean-drt-anaphora-refactor`).
    // "Ripple N" means
    // "When you cast this spell, you may reveal the top N cards of your library… you
    // may cast any of those cards with the same name as this spell without paying
    // their mana costs, then put all revealed cards not cast this way on the bottom
    // of your library in any order." [CR#702.60a] The reveal of the library slice
    // and the cast write; the final clause's subject does not. "Revealed cards" as
    // `theVerbed(reveal, Many)` is refused `[anaphor (verbed (action "reveal") none
    // attributive) many 0]`: the reveal deed stamps no patient. "Those cards" is
    // refused `[anaphor (word card) many 2]`: the slice and the cast cards both
    // reach. Re-mentioning the slice by identity checks, but the cast has moved part
    // of it, which the 2026-10-08 ruling "A moved referent is read back by anaphora"
    // forbids.
)
